# Board Box Editor

Shipped with each new CTR show from **PrepareClickToClaim** / the ClickToRequest watcher when the bootstrap template is **20260822+** (Fix boxes on the boards page + Reports → Board Box Editor).

## Production wiring (intentional)

- Prepare bootstraps `BoardBoxEditor/<YYYYMMDD>/` after RF-DETR detect (editor UI + that show’s `boards/`).
- Reports links use the show slug so the editor always opens the matching boards.
- Do **not** wire the editor into the pricing inbox watcher, PinPricingStudyMVP pipeline, or launchd pricing agents.

## Locations

| Piece | Path |
|---|---|
| Live editor (GitHub Pages) | `BoardBoxEditor/YYYYMMDD/` in ClickToClaim |
| Firebase edits | `boardBoxEditor/{YYYYMMDD}/{stem}` |

URL: `https://finsandpins.github.io/ClickToClaim/BoardBoxEditor/YYYYMMDD/`

## After editing boxes

Save only writes Firebase. Sync into `ClickToClaim/YYYYMMDD/boards` and bump `BOARDS_MANIFEST_VERSION` before relying on CTR clicks/prices.

## Editor UX to preserve

Bright boxes, corner handles, Add/Delete/Undo, Save/Don’t Save/Cancel on leave, iOS pan-y scroll (touch-action none only on boxes/handles). SHOW_SLUG comes from the URL path.
